{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/Steam_GiF_About.gif?t=1744983539\" />While away the hours on the sunkissed shores of your own tiny paradise! Tranquil isle is a minimalist townbuilder, set on idyllic, <strong>randomly generated islands</strong>. The sun will rise and set as you work to <strong>grow</strong> your town\u00a0<strong>to keep everything humming along nicely.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s <strong>no combat</strong>, <strong>no trading</strong>\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0just focus on making your little islands the best they can be. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/Steam_Gif_modes.gif?t=1744983539\" />The game has 2 main modes: <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, where players must strategically place buildings to build up your high score and unlock new buildings and islands, and <strong>sandbox mode</strong> for those looking to <strong>chill out</strong> and build purely for <strong>aesthetics and vibes</strong>. There's also a Daily challenge, where all players will play for a high score on the same fixed map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/steam_Gif_Features.gif?t=1744983539\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>unique mix of townbuilder, roguelite and strategy mechanics</strong>. Each island is <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, offering a fresh challenge each time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing</strong> gameplay that drops features like combat and trading in favour of a more <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>focused</strong> experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Islands come with <strong>day/night</strong> cycles and different visual themes: <strong>grasslands, winter, desert, and more</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/Steam_GiF_plain.gif?t=1744983539\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bob","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/a63f68b37a29d2cb0ef01d11e9d41fb006d26e76.jpg"},{"name":"First Building","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/a63f68b37a29d2cb0ef01d11e9d41fb006d26e76.jpg"},{"name":"Learner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/5ed7570922432cb6f583198911f1728c9b2fd6ea.jpg"},{"name":"Sandbox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/a5f648cd923bc5da341234065610777ddc27ef07.jpg"},{"name":"Save as Sandbox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/099313cf7248df0c78fc408f373c87b3a215e033.jpg"},{"name":"Been around the world, don't speak the language","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/09a7f3208288cc3c44651c628b5f7c52f14bec39.jpg"},{"name":"Happy accidents","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324180/ac35b68934a643eeb90b4297959f16b007aef7f2.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2324180?t=1744983539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2324180?t=1744983539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/1f1782eac7b5602d9233907626871588c784869c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744983539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/1f1782eac7b5602d9233907626871588c784869c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744983539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2733750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/Steam_GiF_About.gif?t=1744983539\" />While away the hours on the sunkissed shores of your own tiny paradise! Tranquil isle is a minimalist townbuilder, set on idyllic, <strong>randomly generated islands</strong>. The sun will rise and set as you work to <strong>grow</strong> your town\u00a0<strong>to keep everything humming along nicely.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s <strong>no combat</strong>, <strong>no trading</strong>\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0just focus on making your little islands the best they can be. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/Steam_Gif_modes.gif?t=1744983539\" />The game has 2 main modes: <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, where players must strategically place buildings to build up your high score and unlock new buildings and islands, and <strong>sandbox mode</strong> for those looking to <strong>chill out</strong> and build purely for <strong>aesthetics and vibes</strong>. There's also a Daily challenge, where all players will play for a high score on the same fixed map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/steam_Gif_Features.gif?t=1744983539\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>unique mix of townbuilder, roguelite and strategy mechanics</strong>. Each island is <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, offering a fresh challenge each time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing</strong> gameplay that drops features like combat and trading in favour of a more <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>focused</strong> experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Islands come with <strong>day/night</strong> cycles and different visual themes: <strong>grasslands, winter, desert, and more</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/extras/Steam_GiF_plain.gif?t=1744983539\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tom Daly"],"dlc":[2971880],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324180/f28ff3f74661daa0163f6dbcbb141731eeb3e9d9/header.jpg?t=1744983539","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS X Yosemite (10.10)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.00 GHz or M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127311,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127311/movie480.mp4?t=1744979569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127311/movie_max.mp4?t=1744979569"},"name":"Launch trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.stea